        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>PDQ KT Extra Heavy Duty Commercial Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFits standard 2-1/8\" pre drilled doors. Available as <B>Single Cylinder</b> (Keyed lock on the outside with thumbturn inside) or <B>Double Cylinder</b> (Keyed lock on both outside and inside).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the PDQ Extra Heavy Duty Commercial Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Door Prop: Fits standard 2-1/8\" door prep.</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 1\" throw with case-hardened roller pin. Brass.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 2-3/4\" x 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Trim: wrought brass.</li>\r\n<li>Keyways: Schlage \"C\" Standard.</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: Brass 6-pin cylinder keyed to 5-pins.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> for PDQ Standard Duty Commercial Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder: Keyed lock cylinder on the outside with thumbturn inside</li>\r\n<li>Double Cylinder: Keyed lock cylinder on both outside and inside</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
